---
args: {"sources": "EvidencePage[]", "clocks": "ObligationClock[]"}
returns: "DeliveryClaim[]"
---
For each artifact, service log or handover message call resolveMilestoneAlias(artifact, clocks). Link only the supported phase and delivered scope. A project-tool rename keeps the original agreement identity and its version history. Preserve partial and alternative delivery without claiming equivalence or acceptance; a related activity log is not the milestone itself.
